====== Xiaomi Mi WiFi Mini ======
The [[http://www.mi.com/miwifimini/|Xiaomi MiWiFi Mini]] is a 802.11ac+bgn wireless router based on the [[https://wikidevi.com/wiki/MediaTek_MT7620|MediaTek MT7620A]] SoC. It has three Ethernet ports and two radios (one SoC-based 2.4 GHz 802.11bgn and one PCI-based MT7612EN 2.4/5GHz 802.11abgnac, wired on 5GHz only, both 2x2 MiMo).

